{"5111420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starving Crow", "steam_appid": 5111420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5145560], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/c320b686c3b16601484fc4a30aba7abc.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are crows. Starving crows. Search for food in this ever-changing world. Do whatever it takes to survive and feed your babies. Crows are clever. You’ll need to be too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I know you thought of that one friend who isn’t exactly the sharpest. Invite them to play and let them prove their worth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/e375e9c422523ebe9088d063fa9c2501.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crows help each other. Sometimes they hate each other. You won’t be any different. You need each other to survive. Want to be greedy and eat everything you can find? Your friend might starve. That’s not nice. Unless they deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/10ac5ddd2de3041093ee95e4cf388df1.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/10ac5ddd2de3041093ee95e4cf388df1.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/10ac5ddd2de3041093ee95e4cf388df1.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/a196c782666f7fa2ee496d51a032b8fa.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans don’t like it when crows steal their food. Run, hide, and do whatever you can to get away with what you found. You’re already going to be worried about your hunger. You don’t need to find out how many times a crow can get whacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/929853a387b954229540a4940a53494f.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/929853a387b954229540a4940a53494f.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/929853a387b954229540a4940a53494f.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/a2a9ff522b582a36ba09095e776a8260.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season, you’ll find new ways to get food. What works in one might not work in another. Adapt, work together, and discover new ways to survive. If crows can do it, you can too. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/e24fc3ca6ea679c4e892ef676d061c08.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/e24fc3ca6ea679c4e892ef676d061c08.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/e24fc3ca6ea679c4e892ef676d061c08.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/ed7d4418e0a3b646ba1b6aacd4bf1e2e.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crows can't talk. Yet. Speak in Crowish and hope your friends understand. Spotted some food? Enemies? Need help? Scream like a desperate crow and see if anyone comes swooping in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your screams also work as an attack. The louder you scream, the stronger the attack. The people you live with are going to absolutely love this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/2ee8e4d2f7a6340ca0ab94759de9822c.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/2ee8e4d2f7a6340ca0ab94759de9822c.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/2ee8e4d2f7a6340ca0ab94759de9822c.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/8cbbdb75502dc6aa6a30a683b26d662c.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flight system rewards those with a good sense of rhythm. Flap your wings to the beat of the music to fly faster. Some challenges to get food also require rhythm. And that's not all. Some of them depend on all your friends being in sync. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! Even that one friend you just thought of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/9e846e1312aff0a9149d0be6a1c48f59.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/9e846e1312aff0a9149d0be6a1c48f59.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/9e846e1312aff0a9149d0be6a1c48f59.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/599281a1fc022fcaec5204c83a86946c.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always that one friend who would make a perfect example of natural selection. If that friend is you, don’t worry! If you die, you’ll be reborn as one of your friends’ babies in the next season, while your friend turns into an old, decrepit crow. What a beautiful way for you and your friends to keep having fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no one saves their babies, no problem. You become a ghost crow and can mess with the enemies. Or your own friends. If you’re still dead, it’s their fault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to 4 crow friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for food in the wild or steal from humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your baby crows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans who hate crows. Or do they?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different seasons with different types of food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-based music system for flying and getting food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat with voice effects that make you and your friends sound like crows </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries… 🎃👻🧙🏻‍♀️</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/c320b686c3b16601484fc4a30aba7abc.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are crows. Starving crows. Search for food in this ever-changing world. Do whatever it takes to survive and feed your babies. Crows are clever. You’ll need to be too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I know you thought of that one friend who isn’t exactly the sharpest. Invite them to play and let them prove their worth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/b535c5f10d6fd1c00e30192e5d10ec10.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/e375e9c422523ebe9088d063fa9c2501.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crows help each other. Sometimes they hate each other. You won’t be any different. You need each other to survive. Want to be greedy and eat everything you can find? Your friend might starve. That’s not nice. Unless they deserve it.</p><p clas