caec5204c83a86946c.webp?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always that one friend who would make a perfect example of natural selection. If that friend is you, don’t worry! If you die, you’ll be reborn as one of your friends’ babies in the next season, while your friend turns into an old, decrepit crow. What a beautiful way for you and your friends to keep having fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no one saves their babies, no problem. You become a ghost crow and can mess with the enemies. Or your own friends. If you’re still dead, it’s their fault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.poster.avif?t=1788254139\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.webm?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/extras/583b4b782daacebfb004402503b4ef61.mp4?t=1788254139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to 4 crow friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for food in the wild or steal from humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your baby crows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans who hate crows. Or do they?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different seasons with different types of food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-based music system for flying and getting food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat with voice effects that make you and your friends sound like crows </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries… 🎃👻🧙🏻‍♀️</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A co-op action game where you and your friends are starving crows. Explore the wilderness, snatch from humans, and do whatever it takes to survive and feed your baby crow, even if that means stealing food from your own friends. Co-op, sure…", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/92c1e1bb4cdab976abf59564def3e70f0cce912e/header.jpg?t=1788254139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/41e2238f03e610e19c7e5fef80f0ad5b949c9d67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788254139", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5111420/41e2238f03e610e19c7e5fef80f0ad5b949c9d67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788254139", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Dirty Bread"], "publishers": ["Dirty Bread"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action